# docxray working files — a Projection's sidecar is never a deliverable (ADR-0006)
.docxray/
/*.dxr

# Fixture staging.
#
# Real documents that have NOT yet been trimmed and sanitised live here and are
# never committed — this repository is public, and a .docx carries more than it
# shows on screen (deleted text inside tracked changes, comments, author and
# company properties).
#
# Trim and sanitise first, then commit the result to tests/fixtures/.
# Documents that cannot be sanitised stay here permanently; tests skip when they
# are absent.
tests/fixtures-local/
